```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([User Initiates Comic Generation]) --> Input[User provides prompt, character, setting, tone, style]
    Input --> Aggregate[Aggregates inputs into Master Prompt]
    
    Aggregate --> FlashCall{Invoke Gemini Flash}
    FlashCall -->|Success| OutlineJSON[5-Panel Outline JSON]
    FlashCall -->|API Unavailable / Error| FallbackOutline[Algorithmic 5-Panel Outline Fallback]
    OutlineJSON --> ScriptCall{Invoke Gemini Pro}
    FallbackOutline --> ScriptCall

    ScriptCall -->|Success| StoryScript[Comic Script with Dialogue, SFX, Captions]
    ScriptCall -->|API Unavailable / Error| FallbackScript[Algorithmic Comic Script Fallback]

    StoryScript --> ImgLoop[Iterate through Panels 1 to 5]
    FallbackScript --> ImgLoop

    ImgLoop --> ImgCheck{Select Image Engine}
    ImgCheck -->|Tier 1| Imagen3[Google Imagen 3 API]
    ImgCheck -->|Tier 2| GeminiSVG[Gemini Comic SVG Engine]
    ImgCheck -->|Tier 3 / Fallback| ScenicPillow[Pillow Scenic Halftone Comic Engine]

    Imagen3 --> PanelPNG[Save Panel PNG in static/panels/]
    GeminiSVG --> PanelPNG
    ScenicPillow --> PanelPNG

    PanelPNG --> LayoutMerge[layout_builder.py binds Images + Text + Metadata]
    LayoutMerge --> PDFGen[exporters.py compiles multi-page A4 PDF]
    PDFGen --> PDFSaved[Save PDF in static/exports/comic_*.pdf]
    
    PDFSaved --> RenderPreview[Render comic_preview.html with Download Link]
    RenderPreview --> End([User reads comic & downloads PDF])
```
